The '''Underground Lab''' is a [[Locations|Location]] in the {{zone|Glowing Mushroom Cave}}. It can be entered by digging {{Item|Coarse Dirt}} at 175 42 -470 after completing {{NPCSprite|Beth}}'s quest.

== Overview ==
Upon accepting {{NPCSprite|Beth}}'s visitor offers {{Green|4}} times, the player can enter the {{Zone|Underground Lab}} where {{NPCSprite|Beth}} will confront {{NPCSprite|Jake}} for the first time. Once the dialogue ends, the player can claim a {{Item|Jake's Plushie}}.

After unlocking the [[Greenhouse]], {{NPCSprite|Beth}} will visit again and the player can enter the {{Zone|Underground Lab}} a second time, revealing a secondary area where the [[Crop Analyzer]] can be accessed after more dialogue between {{NPCSprite|Beth}} and {{NPCSprite|Jake}}.

